originate from the Protein Data Bank and the binding measurements from the
sources curated by the HiQBind workflow (Binding MOAD, BindingDB and BioLiP).
Those upstream records remain subject to the terms of their original
distributions; this notice does not grant additional rights to redistribute,
sell or commercially exploit them.

The MaSIF-derived representations were produced with the publicly released MaSIF
implementation (<https://github.com/LPDI-EPFL/masif>) and remain subject to the
terms of the MaSIF software and of the structures they were computed from.

The Pocket split annotations and the scripts developed specifically for
PocketEval may be reused for research and benchmarking purposes, provided that
PocketEval and the associated publication are cited.

The data and derived representations are provided for research use without
warranty.
